      ],
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/place/Kaskaskia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The original settlement now lies underwater after the Mississippi River shifted eastward in 1881, destroying most of the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
